5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I want us all to get along. Does anyone have a plan for how we should find the werewolf?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I believe a measured approach is best. Let us observe the natural flow of conversation and see whose mask begins to slip.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be in such fine company. Let us be patient and kind. The truth often reveals itself to those who listen with an open heart.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,I'm sure we'll have plenty of fun with this! I'll be watching everyone's expressions. Who do you think is the most likely to be hiding a secret?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not here to play games. Let's just be honest and find the wolf quickly so nobody gets hurt. I'll keep a close eye on everyone.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, you seem very calm. Do you think we should just wait and see, or should we try to ask each other questions right now?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, curiosity is a virtue, but rushing can be a trap. I suggest we maintain this civility while we gauge each other's temperaments.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Benjamin. There is a certain wisdom in silence and observation. Let us allow each person to speak their mind in their own time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, you're so intense! It's almost cute. But maybe being too aggressive will just make people hide their true selves even more, don't you think?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I'm not being aggressive, I'm being serious! If we're too ""polite,"" the wolf will just blend in and eat us one by one.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I think Takumi is just trying to protect us. I'll try my best to be helpful too. I hope the Seer finds something good tonight.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the Seer's first vision will be our first real anchor in this sea of uncertainty. I look forward to seeing how that information shifts the air.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A guiding light in the darkness. We must protect the Seer, for they are the bridge between our ignorance and the truth.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"I wonder who the Seer is! If it's me, I'll be a total pro. If it's someone else, I hope they're brave enough to tell us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, you're too naive. Don't just trust everyone because they're nice. We have to be suspicious of everyone until we have proof.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I understand, Takumi. I'll try to be more careful. I think I'm ready for the night now. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A sensible conclusion for today. I shall retire to my thoughts. I wish you all a night of peaceful reflection.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Servas,,May your dreams be gentle and your hearts remain hopeful. I shall see you all in the morning.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,May,,Goodnight! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf red-handed! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll be staying alert even in my sleep. Goodnight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
