35,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. Since the Seer has information now, does anyone want to share what they found?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning. It is a heavy burden to speak first, but for the sake of the village, I shall reveal that Minato is the werewolf.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Oh, such a shocking revelation so early! Minato, dear, you have such a gentle presence. I hope Benjamin is not mistaken.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,May,,"Wow, Benjamin didn't waste any time! @Minato, you look so innocent, but the Seer says otherwise. What do you have to say for yourself?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I knew something felt off! @Benjamin, are you the Seer? If you're telling the truth, we should just vote Minato out right now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minato,,"What?! No, that's not true! I'm just a villager! @Benjamin, why would you lie about me? I've been nothing but nice to everyone!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your distress is noted, but the vision was quite clear. Logic dictates that the Seer's word is our most reliable tool.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult position for Minato. However, we must weigh the Seer's claim against our own impressions. Minato, please tell us your truth.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're very confident. But if you're actually the wolf, claiming the most innocent person is a great way to gain trust.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, that's a possibility, but Benjamin was the one to step up. Minato is just crying. I'm leaning towards believing Benjamin.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm not lying! I really am human! Please, don't believe him! @Servas, you know I'm a peaceful person, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, your kindness is admirable, but we cannot let emotion cloud the fact that a werewolf has been identified.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I do believe in Minato's spirit, but I also trust Benjamin's composure. This is a most distressing paradox for us all.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm still not 100% sure. @Minato, if you're a villager, do you have any reason why Benjamin would target you specifically?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"He doesn't need a reason if he's the Seer; he just saw the truth. Minato, stop acting and just admit it if you're the wolf!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I can't admit to something I didn't do! I'm so scared... please, just give me one more day to prove I'm human!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Time is a luxury we do not possess. Every night we hesitate is a night another innocent soul is lost.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems the tide has turned. While my heart is heavy, the logic of the Seer's claim is a powerful force.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,May,,"Well, if the majority is convinced, I'll go with the flow. It's better to be safe than sorry, even if it's a mistake.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Minato. We can't risk another night with a known wolf among us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
55,1,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
